        "text": "Touring the Linux Filesystem\nIn this section, I take a look at the contents of the typical Linux filesystem. Being\nat least a bit familiar with it helps you track things down later, and will help you\nto know where it\u2019s safe to mess with things and where you need to be very careful.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 The root of the tree\n\u2022 The importance of being /etc\n\u2022 Where removable media lives\n\u2022 Where the computer is the /usr\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
